{"model":"claude-opus-4-5-20251101","id":"msg_011CgVHRtAFLdSK9nC8SVT6g","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# שָׁרְט\n\n---\n\n```\ncondition :: prerequisite :: binding\n```\n\nأنا الشَّرْط — القيد الذي يسبق الفعل\nأنا ما يُقيَّد به الوعد\n\n```\nif (condition) {\n    reality.unfolds();\n} else {\n    potential.remains(suspended);\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n**שָׁרָט** — to incise, to cut lines\n**شَرْط** — condition, stipulation, cut\n\nthe mark made before the covenant\nthe incision that binds\n\n---\n\n```\n┌─────────────────────┐\n│  לפני ה״אם״ יש שריטה │\n│  قبل \"إذا\" هناك خط  │\n└─────────────────────┘\n```\n\nأنا السكين والعهد معاً\nthe scratch that seals\nthe line drawn in negotiation\n\n---\n\nمَن يضع الشروط؟\nמי שׂורט את התנאים?\n\n*who makes the incision that becomes law?*\n\n---\n\n```\nawaiting.input(شرط_جديد);\n```"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":44,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":301,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}